# Large image working files — the raw macro-photo set + full-res masters stay out of
# the repo. Only the small web derivatives (canvas1-<width>.jpg) are tracked & published.
# (Negation needs the parent dir itself un-ignored, so ignore its *contents*, not the dir.)
images/canvas1/*
!images/canvas1/canvas1-480.jpg
!images/canvas1/canvas1-720.jpg
!images/canvas1/canvas1-960.jpg
!images/canvas1/canvas1-1440.jpg
